+    a. Render the NeRF depth map $\bar{D}_i$ for the camera pose of $I_i$ [S1, unofficial].
+    b. Compute the pseudo-depth map $D^*_i = G_\phi(I_i)$ using the pre-trained MDE network [S1, unofficial].
